protect your fellow citizens</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep the galaxy clean </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Protect endangered alien life forms from other worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">direct space traffic in a orderly fashion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">always carry a spare pair of socks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
